	<mx:Text width="50%" text="{'TODO: This screen presents a graphical diagram of the ' +
		   'query plan, showing iterators grouped into slices and connected by arrows. ' + 
		   'The size of each slice group indicates the amount of cpu elapsed there, ' + 
		   'and the color of each group indicates the current CPU usage and skew. ' + 
		   'The size of each arrow indicates the amount of rows that have travelled ' + 
		   'through it, and the color indicates the current flow and row skew. ' + 
		   'Each iterator has an icon, and a status value. ' + 
		   'Clicking on an iterator will show its full details in the detail pane. ' +
		   'In v1 we will have CPU skew (per slice) and row skew (per iterator) ' +
		   'but otherwise we just average the metrics across the segments.'}"/>
